# macOS menu-bar app build output
macos/QuernMenuBar/build/

# Scratch file for `gh release create --notes-file` (docs/release-channels.md).
# Written per release and not part of the tree; the published notes live on the
# GitHub release. It reached a PR once by way of `git add -A`.
RELEASE_NOTES.md

# Machine-specific release facts: keychain profile name, which install the
# update test runs against, which host holds the tarball check. Values only --
# the procedure lives in docs/release-channels.md. Never secrets; the keychain
# holds those. Copy scripts/release-local-template.md to start one.
RELEASE_LOCAL.md

# A stray `-` at the root: a tool told to write to stdout with `-o -` or `> -`
# creates a file instead. One got committed and shipped in every release
# tarball for two weeks before anyone noticed.
/-
macos/QuernMenuBar/.build/
